                                                "sense_id": "467eef22-1ee2-3fba-ab13-0975bfb7e1be",
                                                "text": "Blank I call it, but it was figured over with the patches that please a painter, repaired breaches, crumblings of plaster, extrusions of brick that had turned pink with time[…]"
